                        <!-- ══════════════════ 1. INTRODUCTION ══════════════════ -->
                        <div class="pr_h2">1. Introduction</div>

                        <div class="pr_h3">1.1 BACKGROUND INFORMATION:</div>
                        <p>
                            This Proposal is compiled by TUV AUSTRIA BUREAU OF INSPECTION &amp; CERTIFICATION,
                            hereinafter called as TUV AUS BIC, for
                            <strong><span t-field="doc.partner_id.name"/></strong>
                            hereinafter called as FFP with the purpose of TUV AUS BIC executing
                            Verification/Validation for FFP the Verification/Validation will be carried out at
                            the nominated FFP site(s). TUV AUS BIC has extensive local and international
                            experience with this method of Verification/Validation processes.
                        </p>

                        <div class="pr_h3">1.2 COMPANY PROFILE:</div>
                        <div class="pr_h4">The TUV AUS BIC Group</div>
                        <p>
                            Before TUV Austria AG. Group took over Moody International Pvt. Limited was the name
                            of the venture. MI was established in Pakistan in the year 1997, and soon achieved
                            the position of market leaders and were rated as a pioneer in the field of
                            certification business in Pakistan.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            In 2011, Moody Group was globally sold to another player and it was decided amicably
                            &amp; concluded between Moody International Pakistan &amp; Moody Group to part ways
                            for the sake of good order. As a result of that negotiation, between the management
                            of Moody International Pakistan and Moody Group the company Moody International
                            Pakistan became 100% independent and subsequently TUV Austria Holding AG., a company
                            established since 1872 acquired shareholding in Moody International Pvt. Limited.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            TUV Austria enjoys major market share in certification business having hundreds of
                            certified clients all over Pakistan and thousands of clients internationally.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            TUV Austria’s Corporate Head Office in Lahore - Pakistan is the South Asian Head
                            Office, having branch offices in Karachi (Pakistan), Islamabad (Pakistan) and
                            Bangladesh.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            TUV Austria is a leading Certification and Inspection Company Globally with its
                            origin and International HQ in Vienna.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            TÜV AUSTRIA has been established as one of the primary auditing leaders in the
                            European, Asian, East Mediterranean and Middle East market in sectors such as Food,
                            Quality, Environment, Health &amp; Safety and Information Security Management
                            Systems Certification and Inspections – Certification of Materials, Products,
                            Machinery and Equipment, Building and Industrial Installations.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Certification Services against the following standards are being offered by
                            TUV AUS BIC;
                        </p>

                        <table class="pr_std">
                            <tr><td class="pr_std_code">ISO 9001</td><td>(QUALITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM)</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="pr_std_code">ISO14001</td><td>(ENVIRONMENT MANAGEMENT SYSTEM)</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="pr_std_code">ISO 45001</td><td>(OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH AND SAFETY)</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="pr_std_code">ISO 22000</td><td>(FOOD &amp; SAFTEY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM)</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="pr_std_code">ISO 27001</td><td>(INFORMATION SECURITY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM)</td></tr>
