                            <tr><td class="pr_std_code">HALAL</td><td>(HALAL FOOD CERTIFICATION AS PER PS 3733)</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="pr_std_code">HACCP</td><td>(HAZARD ANALYSIS &amp; CRITICAL CONTROL POINT)</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="pr_std_code">FSSC 22000</td><td>(FOOD SAFETY SYSTEM CERTIFICATION)</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="pr_std_code">TAC 16000</td><td>(FIRE PROTECTION MANGEMENT SYSTEM)</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="pr_std_code">ISO14064-1</td><td>(GREENHOUSE GASES -PART 1)</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="pr_std_code">ISO 14064-2</td><td>(GREENHOUSE GASES -PART 2)</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="pr_std_code">PAS 2060</td><td>(CARBON NEUTRALITY)</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="pr_std_code">EN 15343</td><td>(RECYCLED PLASTICS)</td></tr>
                            <tr><td class="pr_std_code">OK Recycled</td><td/></tr>
                        </table>

                        <p>
                            TÜV AUSTRIA BIC has won the trust of the market by providing accredited technical
                            services. The services provided in the fields of Audit, Certification, Technical
                            Inspection and Training are:
                        </p>
                        <ul class="pr_ul">
                            <li>
                                Assessment and Certification of Management Systems based on the requirement of
                                ISO 9001, ISO 14001, EMAS Regulation, HACCP, ISO 22000, FSSC 22000, BRC, IFS,
                                IFS Logistics, IFS Broker, ISO 45001, ISO 13485, SA 8000, ΕΝ 16001, ISO 50001,
                                AGRO 2.1- 2.2, AGRO 3.1- 3.2- 3.3- 3.4, GLOBALG.A.P. Protocol, ISO 27001,
                                BS 25999, ISO 20000.
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                Audits and Certifications according to ISO17021-1, ISO 22003-1, ELOT 1433,
                                ELOT 1429, ELOT 1435, ΕΝ 15733
                            </li>
                            <li>Environment and Energy Audits, Inspections and Measurements.</li>
                            <li>
                                Renewable Sources of Energy- Photovoltaic and Wind Air Generators Inspections.
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                Verification of Greenhouse Gases (CO2) emissions reports according to the
                                Emission Trading Scheme.
                            </li>
                            <li>
                                Lift Inspections- CE Type Approval, Safety Construction Elements of CE type,
                                Technical Inspections, Certification of Quality Assurance Systems according to
                                EC 95/16 directive.
                            </li>
                            <li>Inspection of Industrial Building Installations and Metallic Constructions.</li>
                            <li>Inspection of Buildings with N.D.T. / N.D.E. methods.</li>
                            <li>
                                Inspection Body of Quality Assurance in Civil Engineers Projects, Building and
