                        <!-- ══════════════════ 2. TECHNICAL PROPOSAL ══════════════════ -->
                        <div class="pr_h2">2. Technical Proposal (Audit Methodology)</div>

                        <div class="pr_h3">2.1 STAGE - 1 DOCUMENT REVIEW:</div>
                        <p>
                            TUV AUS BIC will carry out Stage 1 Audit of your
                            <strong><span t-field="doc.management_system_name"/> MANAGEMENT SYSTEM</strong>
                            emissions according to the Verification Regulation and the requirements of
                            <strong><span t-field="doc.certification_standard"/></strong> standard In order to
                            establish to what extent, the
                            <strong><span t-field="doc.management_system_name"/> MANAGEMENT SYSTEM</strong>
                            addresses the requirements of
                            <strong><span t-field="doc.certification_standard"/></strong> Standard, and if a
                            subsequent final Assessment for Accredited Certificate is likely to result in
                            successful certification at an early stage, by which usually companies take the
                            necessary corrective/preventive actions as appropriate and prior to the final
                            Assessment. Audit Reports will be compiled as per the requirements specified and
                            will be sent to necessary action if required.
                        </p>

                        <div class="pr_h3">2.2 STAGE - 2 VERIFICATION AUDIT:</div>
                        <p>
                            TUV AUS BIC shall conduct onsite Verification audit according to the Verification
                            Regulation and the requirements of
                            <strong><span t-field="doc.certification_standard"/></strong> standard and award the
                            Verification Statement stating the result of the verification process in case of a
                            positive result.
                        </p>

                        <div class="pr_h3">2.3 ACCREDITATION LOGOS:</div>
                        <p>TUV AUS BIC shall offer PNAC Accredited Certificate.</p>

                        <div class="pr_h3">2.4 ROUTINE SURVEILLANCE VISITS:</div>
                        <p>
                            It is also an obligatory service TUV AUS BIC will perform Surveillance Visit after
                            every year i.e. 2 Surveillance Visits will be performed during the 3 years
                            validation period of the Certificate during the three years validation.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Such routine Surveillance Visits are performed to ensure the continuous compliance
                            of your
                            <strong><span t-field="doc.management_system_name"/> MANAGEMENT SYSTEM</strong>
                            to the requirements of
                            <strong><span t-field="doc.certification_standard"/></strong> Standard.
                        </p>

                        <!-- ══════════════════ 3. FINANCIAL PROPOSAL ══════════════════ -->
                        <div class="pr_h2">
                            3. Financial Proposal (Summary of TUV Austria BIC Service Charges)
                        </div>

                        <div class="pr_h3">3.1 CHARGES</div>
                        <t t-set="charge_rows" t-value="[
                            ('Stage 1 Audit:', doc.charge_stage_1_audit),
                            ('Stage 2 Audit:', doc.charge_stage_2_audit),
                            ('Traveling, Boarding &amp; Lodging', doc.travel_boarding_lodging),
                            ('1ST Annual Surveillance@', doc.charge_surveillance_1),
                            ('2nd Annual Surveillance@', doc.charge_surveillance_2),
                        ]"/>
                        <table class="pr_charges">
                            <colgroup><col style="width: 46%;"/><col style="width: 54%;"/></colgroup>
                            <tr t-foreach="[r for r in charge_rows if r[1]]" t-as="row">
                                <td class="pr_ch_lbl"><span t-out="row[0]"/></td>
                                <td>=<span t-out="row[1]"/></td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <div class="pr_h4">Summary of Cost</div>
                        <table class="pr_cost">
                            <colgroup>
                                <col style="width: 24%;"/><col style="width: 19%;"/>
                                <col style="width: 19%;"/><col style="width: 19%;"/>
                                <col style="width: 19%;"/>
                            </colgroup>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Standard(s)</th>
                                <th>Initial Audit</th>
                                <th>1st Surveillance Audit</th>
                                <th>2nd Surveillance Audit</th>
                                <th>Total</th>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td class="pr_cost_row">
                                    <span t-field="doc.certification_standard"/> CERTIFICATION
                                </td>
                                <td><span t-field="doc.cost_initial_audit"/></td>
                                <td><span t-field="doc.cost_surveillance_1"/></td>
                                <td><span t-field="doc.cost_surveillance_2"/></td>
                                <td><span t-field="doc.cost_total"/></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td class="pr_cost_row"><span t-field="doc.cost_tax_label"/></td>
                                <td><span t-field="doc.cost_tax_initial_audit"/></td>
                                <td><span t-field="doc.cost_tax_surveillance_1"/></td>
                                <td><span t-field="doc.cost_tax_surveillance_2"/></td>
                                <td><span t-field="doc.cost_tax_total"/></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr class="pr_cost_total">
                                <td class="pr_cost_row">Total</td>
                                <td><span t-field="doc.cost_grand_initial_audit"/></td>
                                <td><span t-field="doc.cost_grand_surveillance_1"/></td>
                                <td><span t-field="doc.cost_grand_surveillance_2"/></td>
                                <td><span t-field="doc.cost_grand_total"/></td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <div class="pr_note">NOTE: NO HIDDEN CHARGES OR OVER &amp; ABOVE THIS COST</div>

                        <!-- advance = "Total" row / "Initial Audit" column of the cost table -->
                        <t t-set="advance"
                            t-value="(doc.cost_grand_initial_audit or '').replace('USD', '').replace('$', '').strip()"/>
                        <div class="pr_h3">3.2 Invoicing:</div>
                        <p>
                            <span t-field="doc.proposal_invoicing_terms"/><t t-if="advance">
                            i.e., <strong>USD <span t-out="advance"/></strong></t>
                            only is required to initiate the contract.
                        </p>

                        <div class="pr_h3">3.3 Contract:</div>
                        <p>
                            Once the terms &amp; condition are agreed between both the parties a formal contract
                            will be sent to you for signatures.
                        </p>

                        <div class="pr_note">
                            NOTE: THIS PROPOSAL IS VALID FOR 30 DAYS FROM DATE OF ISSUE<t
                                t-if="doc.validity_date"> (UP TO <span t-field="doc.validity_date"
                                t-options='{"widget": "date", "format": "MMMM dd, yyyy"}'/>)</t>.
                        </div>

                        <!-- ══════════════════ SIGNATURE ══════════════════ -->
                        <div class="pr_sign">
                            <t t-set="pb_name" t-value="doc.prepared_by_name"/>
                            <t t-set="pb_job" t-value="doc.prepared_by_designation"/>
                            <t t-set="pb_phone" t-value="doc.prepared_by_phone"/>
                            <t t-set="pb_email" t-value="doc.prepared_by_email"/>
                            <div class="pr_sign_lbl">Prepared by:</div>
                            <div class="pr_sign_name" t-if="pb_name"><span t-out="pb_name"/></div>
                            <div class="pr_sign_img" t-if="doc.prepared_by_signature">
                                <img t-att-src="image_data_uri(doc.prepared_by_signature)" alt="Signature"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="pr_sign_gap" t-else=""/>
                            <div t-if="pb_job"><span t-out="pb_job"/></div>
                            <div><span t-field="doc.company_id.name"/></div>
                            <div t-if="pb_phone"><span t-out="pb_phone"/></div>
                            <div t-if="pb_email"><span t-out="pb_email"/></div>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </t>
            </t>
        </t>
    </template>

</odoo>
